Q9Y3I0
) and DDX1 (UniProt
Q92499
) were cloned into UC Berkeley MacroLab 5B vector (gift from Scott Gradia, Addgene plasmid #30122) with DDX1 inserted into site 1 to generate a fusion with an N-terminal His
