32
P] cytidine-3′,5-bisphosphate (222 TBq mmol
–1
, Hartmann Analytic) and 10 units T4 RNA ligase 1 (NEB) in a total reaction volume of 20 µl containing 15% (v/v) DMSO, 50 mM Tris-HCl pH 7.6, 10 mM MgCl
2
